<title>BELGIUM: EU gives 5-yr exemption to Finnish roundwood deal.</title>
<headline>EU gives 5-yr exemption to Finnish roundwood deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Tuesday it had decided to grant a five-year exemption to the Finnish roundwood trade arrangements.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that important changes had been agreed after the commission indicated the arrangements restricted competition.</p>
<p>&quot;Forest industry companies accepted to bring their cooperation in pricing issues to en end. Forest owners, on the other hand, will appoint joint representatives for negotiations with individual buyers,&quot; the Commission said, adding that it would re-examine the case in five years time.</p>
</text>
